SUMMARY:Trivia @ Revolution - Morristown
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n## The De
 ets\n\nYou've probably seen this place once before\nand just in case you h
 aven't\, you're invited!\n\nThe Revolution in Morristown is probably one o
 f the best bars for trivia in the state! Seated at the "American Revolutio
 n Capitol of the United States"\, it's no wonder why the bar is called **R
 evolution**.\n\nCome on in!\nMake friends\, play trivia\, socialize\, etc.
 \n**Everyone's welcome! 21+**
